00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:49.020
And sometimes you can just blow those up by ramming your little circular mace thing at it, or you're going to need something else.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.840
There's no real rules on that one.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:06:04.100
The whole idea of it being like some things require things that you have to choose to use that that's very unclear, but that's what I mean by puzzler.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.140
Yeah, I get what you're saying though.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:14.220
