Alright, I'm gonna use the rest of my time to talk about the sound effects, because I was very rudely interrupted, uh, by Mike.

00:30:20.820 --> 00:30:28.240
Um, so, like, I think the voop-voop is, like, what it would sound like if you were in this weird, like, space-based.

00:30:28.580 --> 00:30:34.540
Uh, and the music is if you, like, you can't handle that kind of realism.

00:30:34.540 --> 00:30:39.520
Um, that being said, it's a really weird game.

00:30:39.820 --> 00:30:41.100
It's a unique game.

00:30:41.240 --> 00:30:43.380
Like, you know, I appreciate unique.

00:30:45.020 --> 00:30:51.820
And some of the, like, the powers that you use, I thought they were very cool, the way that they were used.

00:30:51.940 --> 00:30:54.940
But also, not the...

00:30:54.940 --> 00:30:57.640
Not, like, not, like, crazy cool.

00:30:57.800 --> 00:30:59.080
Like, only, like, kinda cool.

00:30:59.080 --> 00:31:01.560
So, this is not an Essential Game.

00:31:01.620 --> 00:31:03.120
It's actually very strange.

00:31:03.460 --> 00:31:06.440
Like, I don't know how this got on the NES.

00:31:07.040 --> 00:31:09.740
So, um, that's me.

00:31:10.200 --> 00:31:18.040
Joe? Yeah, like I said, I think that, uh, there's something neat here about this idea.

00:31:18.760 --> 00:31:24.860
Uh, it's, yeah, it's a very, like, basic and crude version of that idea.

00:31:24.860 --> 00:31:29.840
That it almost feels like it's just, like, a concept right now, or it's, like, a proof of concept, rather.

00:31:31.540 --> 00:31:33.020
So, no, not Essential.

00:31:33.280 --> 00:31:38.040
Sorry, this is a little awkward, because I kind of accidentally in the middle of this episode just gave my Essential vote.

00:31:38.280 --> 00:31:40.060
Like, what I thought they could have done better.

00:31:40.220 --> 00:31:41.240
So, no, not Essential.

00:31:42.180 --> 00:31:47.680
All right. Uh, and I agree that the idea is really fun and kinda reminds me of Air Fortress.

00:31:47.860 --> 00:31:49.100
So, go play Air Fortress.

00:31:49.240 --> 00:31:53.040
It's a better game. Uh, this is a little too tough and a little too short.

00:31:53.140 --> 00:31:54.680
So, it is what it is.

